::recipe
name: Example
serves: 2
source: https://example.org/recipe#original

::ingredients
(flour; plain) !250g
(egg: yolk) 2
(gin; London dry @ ~Beefeater) 50ml
(cocktail bitters @ !Peychaud's) 0.5g
(sugar) ~10g
(water) ~~100ml

::equipment
(mixing bowl)
(oven)

::instructions
{dough} = (flour) + (egg: yolk)
{dough} <mix, in (mixing bowl)>
    <rest, 20m>
{cake} <bake, 180C> ?= golden brown
Optional [
    {dough} + (sugar)
]
Meanwhile [
    (water) <heat, 1m>
]
Repeat [
    {dough} <mix>
]
until smooth
(flour) 1 1/2 cups / 250g
(water) 3 tbsp / 1 tsp
(gin) -OR- (water)
# example comment

